WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:36.500
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.770 --> 01:38.979
[The Lament of Autumn]

3
01:39.440 --> 01:41.700
[Episode 21]

4
01:41.990 --> 01:42.450
[Chunfeng Troupe]

5
01:42.450 --> 01:44.580
This play about Lyu Bicheng and Qiu Jin

6
01:44.960 --> 01:47.360
explores how these two women, known together as the "Twin Heroines,"

7
01:47.360 --> 01:49.120
both aspired to bring peace and justice to the world.

8
01:49.120 --> 01:50.520
We need to dig deeper into

9
01:50.680 --> 01:52.810
the differences in their ideologies.

10
01:52.870 --> 01:54.930
They both fought for women's rights,

11
01:55.150 --> 01:57.280
but Qiu Jin advocated revolution,

12
01:57.310 --> 01:59.640
while Lyu Bicheng championed education.

13
02:00.060 --> 02:00.900
Qiu Jin believed

14
02:00.900 --> 02:03.420
that overthrowing external oppression was an urgent priority.

15
02:03.420 --> 02:04.680
Lyu Bicheng, on the other hand,

16
02:04.680 --> 02:07.450
believed that if people lacked a strong desire

17
02:07.450 --> 02:10.250
for independence and freedom within themselves,

18
02:14.520 --> 02:16.450
then no matter how fierce the external struggle,

19
02:16.450 --> 02:17.650
what good would it do?

20
02:17.800 --> 02:18.430
Director Liang.

21
02:18.430 --> 02:20.060
See if my interpretation sounds right.

22
02:20.060 --> 02:20.530
I feel

23
02:20.530 --> 02:21.590
that both women

24
02:21.590 --> 02:22.470
had valid ideas.

25
02:22.470 --> 02:23.660
They just approached the issue

26
02:23.660 --> 02:24.310
from different angles.

27
02:24.310 --> 02:24.960
Exactly.

28
02:25.180 --> 02:26.670
Keep thinking it over.

29
02:26.750 --> 02:27.550
-Okay. -Okay.

30
02:40.380 --> 02:40.910
Pingjun.

31
02:42.970 --> 02:44.100
Is everything okay?

32
02:44.350 --> 02:45.600
Is something wrong?

33
02:47.530 --> 02:49.120
Just some family stuff.

34
02:50.500 --> 02:51.430
Director Liang.

35
02:51.680 --> 02:52.770
Would it be okay

36
02:52.930 --> 02:54.680
if I left work a little early today?

37
02:54.680 --> 02:55.560
Of course.

38
02:58.560 --> 03:00.520
If anything's wrong,

39
03:01.310 --> 03:02.510
be sure to let me know.

40
03:04.250 --> 03:05.060
Thank you.

41
03:05.820 --> 03:07.050
[Yuchun Theater]

42
03:07.050 --> 03:14.130
[Opera House]

43
03:54.870 --> 03:56.840
Let go! Who are you guys?

44
03:56.840 --> 03:57.710
[Oil-Paper Umbrellas]

45
03:57.710 --> 03:58.470
Help!

46
03:58.579 --> 04:00.020
-Help! -Keep it down!

47
04:00.240 --> 04:00.370
[Ma's Jade Store]

48
04:00.370 --> 04:01.240
Help!

49
04:02.130 --> 04:02.930
Help!

50
04:19.130 --> 04:20.680
[Chapter 1: A Glimpse of the Ivory Tower]

51
04:22.510 --> 04:23.170
Master Jin!

52
04:23.600 --> 04:24.260
Master Jin!

53
04:24.310 --> 04:25.810
Something bad happened!

54
04:45.690 --> 04:48.659
[29: Ye Pingjun]

55
04:52.390 --> 04:52.980
[Prayer]

56
04:52.980 --> 04:55.930
Thank you, Bodhisattva, for letting him return safely from the battlefield.

57
04:55.930 --> 04:57.970
Are you here to pay respects to your loved one too?

58
04:57.970 --> 04:58.290
You must miss him a lot.

59
04:58.290 --> 04:59.220
[The body returns to dust, but true love never fades.]

60
04:59.220 --> 05:01.620
Otherwise, I would never have the chance

61
05:01.620 --> 05:02.770
to thank him in person.

62
05:02.770 --> 05:04.720
Is he someone you love dearly?

63
05:05.190 --> 05:06.770
Pretending not to love someone

64
05:06.770 --> 05:08.110
can be so painful.

65
05:08.320 --> 05:10.180
I have come again specifically to express my gratitude.

66
05:10.180 --> 05:12.660
May we each find peace from now on,

67
05:12.690 --> 05:14.620
and may everything go well for him.

68
05:22.750 --> 05:23.410
Changxuan!

69
05:24.320 --> 05:25.860
Ruitong, what are you doing here?

70
05:25.860 --> 05:26.860
Master Jin called

71
05:27.060 --> 05:27.560
and said Miss Ye

72
05:27.560 --> 05:28.370
was kidnapped outside

73
05:28.370 --> 05:29.230
Xiangxi Hotel.

74
05:31.810 --> 05:32.560
Who did it?

75
05:33.010 --> 05:34.350
Master Jin traced the license plate.

76
05:34.350 --> 05:35.720
The car belongs to the Tao household.

77
05:35.720 --> 05:36.620
The gatekeeper saw it

78
05:36.620 --> 05:37.110
heading west

79
05:37.110 --> 05:38.280
along East Second Street.

80
05:38.280 --> 05:41.210
I've already sent men to seal off the intersections.

81
06:28.750 --> 06:29.360
Mr. Yu.

82
06:29.420 --> 06:30.220
The city guards confirmed that,

83
06:30.220 --> 06:31.420
at the time Master Jin specified,

84
06:31.420 --> 06:31.890
a car did leave here

85
06:31.890 --> 06:33.430
heading toward Yuhe Bridge.

86
06:33.430 --> 06:33.870
I've sent

87
06:33.870 --> 06:35.270
2 security squads there.

88
06:35.630 --> 06:36.490
To Yuhe Bridge!

89
06:36.560 --> 06:36.930
Yes, sir!

90
06:36.930 --> 06:37.790
Come on! Hurry!

91
06:40.330 --> 06:41.250
Get on! Quick!

92
06:49.159 --> 06:50.000
I never wanted

93
06:50.420 --> 06:51.190
to lay a hand

94
06:51.190 --> 06:52.830
on a young woman like you.

95
06:53.630 --> 06:54.330
But

96
06:54.980 --> 06:57.950
first, you injured my daughter's face,

97
06:58.070 --> 06:59.470
and I let you off the hook.

98
06:59.570 --> 07:01.770
And now, you actually have the audacity

99
07:02.060 --> 07:03.950
to try to steal her fiancé.

100
07:04.830 --> 07:06.180
As her father,

101
07:06.660 --> 07:08.260
I must hold you accountable.

102
07:20.270 --> 07:20.950
You...

103
07:24.660 --> 07:27.120
You... Do you know Ye Zhaohe?

104
07:37.370 --> 07:38.830
Scared now, are you?

105
07:40.500 --> 07:41.770
Too late.

106
07:42.750 --> 07:44.730
No one can save you today.

107
07:45.510 --> 07:46.570
Listen carefully.

108
07:47.430 --> 07:49.370
Get down on your knees before my daughter

109
07:49.370 --> 07:50.750
and apologize to her.

110
07:51.190 --> 07:52.690
Then take your mother

111
07:53.370 --> 07:54.750
and leave Nanhuai.

112
08:02.580 --> 08:04.950
I haven't done anything wrong.

113
08:06.560 --> 08:07.070
Why should I

114
08:07.070 --> 08:08.570
apologize to Tao Ziyi?

115
08:09.860 --> 08:10.430
And why should I

116
08:10.430 --> 08:12.040
leave Nanhuai?

117
08:12.720 --> 08:13.810
You bastard!

118
08:15.540 --> 08:17.040
A lowborn illegitimate daughter

119
08:17.040 --> 08:19.680
like you

120
08:19.920 --> 08:20.770
has no right

121
08:20.770 --> 08:22.370
to compete with my daughter!

122
08:23.360 --> 08:24.820
I've never let my daughter

123
08:25.220 --> 08:26.840
suffer a single grievance

124
08:26.870 --> 08:28.160
in her life.

125
08:28.510 --> 08:29.920
She's the moon in the heavens,

126
08:29.920 --> 08:31.120
while you're nothing

127
08:31.270 --> 08:33.240
but a weed growing in the mud.

128
08:40.840 --> 08:43.100
Mr. Tao, what a wonderful father you are.

129
08:44.580 --> 08:46.310
Tao Ziyi has been spoiled by you

130
08:46.550 --> 08:48.010
her entire life.

131
08:48.800 --> 08:51.020
It's truly something to envy.

132
08:52.980 --> 08:53.860
I know.

133
08:54.580 --> 08:56.400
It's precisely because

134
08:57.050 --> 08:59.510
your own father failed to teach you properly

135
09:00.750 --> 09:03.520
that you've become so unreasonable,

136
09:03.940 --> 09:05.700
always dreaming of marrying into a wealthy family

137
09:05.700 --> 09:07.030
and becoming a phoenix.

138
09:07.740 --> 09:08.770
But what a pity.

139
09:09.460 --> 09:11.100
Everyone has their own destiny.

140
09:11.100 --> 09:13.370
If you think you can climb into the Yu family

141
09:13.370 --> 09:15.480
by stepping on my daughter's shoulders,

142
09:15.480 --> 09:17.740
you're bound to crash and burn!

143
09:22.460 --> 09:23.770
So what do you want?

144
09:24.650 --> 09:25.980
Are you going to kill me?

145
09:31.410 --> 09:33.170
I'll give you one last chance.

146
09:34.170 --> 09:35.330
Get down on your knees

147
09:35.330 --> 09:36.390
before my daughter

148
09:36.460 --> 09:37.670
and apologize,

149
09:37.980 --> 09:39.380
and I'll spare your life.

150
09:44.170 --> 09:45.080
Mr. Tao.

151
09:46.370 --> 09:47.630
I may not have a father,

152
09:48.870 --> 09:50.000
but that doesn't mean

153
09:50.000 --> 09:52.200
anyone can just bully me as they please.

154
09:52.860 --> 09:53.740
It doesn't mean

155
09:54.100 --> 09:55.360
I should take the blame for something

156
09:55.360 --> 09:56.720
I didn't do.

157
09:58.360 --> 09:59.410
I will never beg Tao Ziyi

158
09:59.410 --> 10:00.630
for forgiveness,

159
10:02.250 --> 10:03.250
because I've done

160
10:04.960 --> 10:05.910
nothing wrong.

161
11:59.220 --> 11:59.750
Freeze!

162
12:00.670 --> 12:01.120
Get down!

163
12:01.120 --> 12:01.650
Get down!

164
12:01.740 --> 12:02.270
Get down!

165
12:04.200 --> 12:04.770
Get down!

166
12:05.700 --> 12:06.290
Changxuan!

167
12:06.290 --> 12:06.860
Mr. Yu.

168
12:41.550 --> 12:42.350
Yu Changxuan!

169
12:43.700 --> 12:45.620
First you broke off the engagement with my daughter,

170
12:45.620 --> 12:46.720
and now you're brazenly

171
12:46.720 --> 12:48.320
trying to rescue this woman.

172
12:48.390 --> 12:49.130
You really don't have

173
12:49.130 --> 12:50.460
any respect for me, do you?

174
12:50.460 --> 12:52.130
All of this is my fault.

175
12:52.740 --> 12:54.410
I'm willing to take full responsibility

176
12:54.410 --> 12:55.810
for the harm done to Ziyi.

177
12:56.500 --> 12:58.360
If you're angry, take it out on me.

178
12:58.530 --> 12:59.550
Pingjun has had nothing to do

179
12:59.550 --> 13:01.370
with any of this from the very beginning.

180
13:01.370 --> 13:02.440
I won't let anyone

181
13:02.440 --> 13:03.320
hurt her.

182
13:08.910 --> 13:09.600
Fall back.

183
13:43.680 --> 13:46.240
Do... Do you know Ye Zhaohe?

184
13:52.790 --> 13:53.250
Hurry!

185
13:53.650 --> 13:55.510
Catch up with Yu Changxuan's car!

186
13:58.590 --> 14:00.860
[Ward 8]

187
14:03.290 --> 14:04.220
Deputy Commander Yu.

188
14:04.220 --> 14:05.420
Please rest assured.

189
14:05.600 --> 14:07.120
Although this young lady swallowed some water,

190
14:07.120 --> 14:08.340
she was fortunately rescued in time

191
14:08.340 --> 14:09.670
and is now out of danger.

192
14:09.670 --> 14:10.910
She just needs plenty of rest

193
14:10.910 --> 14:13.190
to recover her strength, and she'll be fine.

194
14:13.190 --> 14:15.190
Alright, we'll leave you two alone.

195
14:16.430 --> 14:22.520
[Ward 8]

196
14:23.150 --> 14:23.770
Move.

197
14:24.750 --> 14:24.810
Let me in.

198
14:24.810 --> 14:25.870
[Ward 8]

199
14:25.870 --> 14:27.330
I need to see Yu Changxuan.

200
14:27.650 --> 14:29.380
President Tao, you can't go in.

201
14:29.380 --> 14:31.110
Then have him come out to see me.

202
14:47.010 --> 14:47.750
Uncle Tao.

203
14:48.100 --> 14:49.100
I've already said

204
14:49.960 --> 14:51.980
I'll take full responsibility for all the consequences.

205
14:51.980 --> 14:53.250
I'm not here to hurt her.

206
14:53.250 --> 14:54.150
I just want to ask her

207
14:54.150 --> 14:54.820
where she got

208
14:54.820 --> 14:55.650
this half of the jade pendant

209
14:55.650 --> 14:56.950
and who gave it to her.

210
14:57.460 --> 14:58.980
It's not a good time for you to go in right now.

211
14:58.980 --> 15:01.310
I have to get to the bottom of this with her.

212
15:01.330 --> 15:01.460
[Ward 8]

213
15:01.460 --> 15:02.340
Pingjun!

214
15:02.740 --> 15:04.010
How is Pingjun?

215
15:05.650 --> 15:06.950
Mr. Yu.

216
15:07.170 --> 15:08.770
How is Pingjun doing?

217
15:09.130 --> 15:10.220
Don't worry, Auntie.

218
15:10.220 --> 15:11.740
The doctor has checked on her.

219
15:11.740 --> 15:12.600
She'll be fine.

220
15:13.750 --> 15:14.770
Who did this?

221
15:16.770 --> 15:18.600
Who has Pingjun offended?

222
15:19.370 --> 15:21.570
I heard Staff Officer Li say on the phone

223
15:22.240 --> 15:24.100
that she was pushed into the lake.

224
15:25.470 --> 15:26.930
What kind of monster

225
15:26.950 --> 15:28.800
would do such a thing?

226
15:31.320 --> 15:32.490
Shuwan...

227
15:40.220 --> 15:42.560
[Ward 8]

228
16:04.670 --> 16:05.550
Shuwan.

229
16:07.700 --> 16:09.560
You left without a word back then.

230
16:11.200 --> 16:12.500
Where did you go?

231
16:13.180 --> 16:15.030
I've been looking for you all this time,

232
16:15.030 --> 16:16.940
but I never heard from you.

233
16:20.510 --> 16:22.650
When I decided to leave,

234
16:23.740 --> 16:24.790
I wanted nothing more

235
16:24.790 --> 16:26.170
to do with you.

236
16:28.600 --> 16:29.700
I know

237
16:30.030 --> 16:31.560
I was in the wrong back then.

238
16:31.820 --> 16:33.360
But please, hear me out.

239
16:33.910 --> 16:34.980
I really had

240
16:34.980 --> 16:36.320
my reasons.

241
16:37.050 --> 16:37.790
I...

242
16:41.460 --> 16:43.410
You had your reasons?

243
16:46.910 --> 16:48.050
Tao Xili.

244
16:49.510 --> 16:50.910
Back then, you settled me

245
16:51.370 --> 16:53.870
in that little courtyard in Yi County

246
16:55.790 --> 16:57.240
and swore up and down

247
16:57.240 --> 16:59.390
that you'd marry me.

248
17:00.150 --> 17:01.900
I believed with all my heart

249
17:02.120 --> 17:04.650
that you'd given me a promise I could count on.

250
17:05.380 --> 17:08.420
But what I ended up getting

251
17:09.589 --> 17:12.290
was your wedding announcement

252
17:12.960 --> 17:14.990
with Miss Tang

253
17:15.010 --> 17:16.609
in the newspaper.

254
17:17.480 --> 17:19.420
Is that your "reason"?

255
17:21.290 --> 17:22.109
I know

256
17:23.220 --> 17:24.510
nothing I say now

257
17:24.960 --> 17:26.970
can make up for what I did.

258
17:27.270 --> 17:28.940
But sometimes, all it takes

259
17:28.960 --> 17:30.520
is one opportunity

260
17:30.660 --> 17:32.520
to change the course of your life.

261
17:32.960 --> 17:33.830
You know,

262
17:34.420 --> 17:35.480
back then, I was only

263
17:35.480 --> 17:37.310
a low-ranking bank clerk,

264
17:37.590 --> 17:38.990
barely making ends meet.

265
17:39.150 --> 17:40.340
I couldn't even

266
17:40.370 --> 17:41.200
support myself,

267
17:41.200 --> 17:42.660
let alone you.

268
17:43.330 --> 17:45.700
But marrying into the Tang family

269
17:46.240 --> 17:48.970
could have changed everything for me overnight.

270
17:49.330 --> 17:51.030
How could I turn that down?

271
17:52.420 --> 17:53.350
It's not that

272
17:53.350 --> 17:54.880
I never thought about our future.

273
17:54.880 --> 17:56.210
I'd already made a plan.

274
17:56.310 --> 17:57.500
Once I'd established myself

275
17:57.500 --> 17:59.100
in the Tang family in 3 years,

276
17:59.250 --> 18:00.850
I'd immediately come for you

277
18:00.850 --> 18:02.160
and marry you into the family. I...

278
18:02.160 --> 18:04.220
How can you be so shameless?

279
18:06.010 --> 18:07.850
You broke your promise,

280
18:07.920 --> 18:09.700
climbed the social ladder by clinging to the powerful,

281
18:09.700 --> 18:11.070
and even tried to turn me

282
18:11.070 --> 18:13.270
into a concubine living in the shadows.

283
18:13.680 --> 18:15.110
Are you even human?

284
18:22.110 --> 18:25.970
[Quiet]

285
18:29.700 --> 18:31.250
Thank you, Deputy Commander,

286
18:31.250 --> 18:32.710
for saving Pingjun today.

287
18:33.590 --> 18:34.650
It's getting late.

288
18:35.550 --> 18:37.080
I won't keep you any longer.

289
18:37.830 --> 18:38.700
I'll stay here

290
18:39.510 --> 18:40.570
until she wakes up.

291
18:44.000 --> 18:46.330
You're a very busy man, Deputy Commander.

292
18:47.050 --> 18:48.980
You needn't concern yourself

293
18:49.500 --> 18:50.900
with our family affairs.

294
18:51.610 --> 18:52.510
I saved her.

295
18:53.720 --> 18:56.050
It's my responsibility to look after her.

296
18:59.180 --> 19:00.290
She's my fiancée.

297
19:01.500 --> 19:02.960
I'll take good care of her.

298
19:08.350 --> 19:08.980
If you were truly capable

299
19:08.980 --> 19:10.640
of protecting her, Mr. Jiang,

300
19:11.790 --> 19:12.810
I wouldn't have had to

301
19:12.810 --> 19:13.540
keep stepping in

302
19:13.540 --> 19:15.000
to help her time and again,

303
19:16.330 --> 19:17.010
would I?

304
19:25.440 --> 19:26.350
Tao Xili,

305
19:27.110 --> 19:28.350
let me tell you.

306
19:29.750 --> 19:30.880
My daughter

307
19:31.590 --> 19:33.220
will not be dragged into

308
19:33.220 --> 19:34.700
anyone's love affairs.

309
19:36.290 --> 19:38.200
You ruined my life,

310
19:39.220 --> 19:42.200
and now you've nearly

311
19:42.200 --> 19:43.660
cost my daughter her life.

312
19:46.270 --> 19:48.050
Who do you think you are?

313
19:53.310 --> 19:53.830
Wait,

314
19:54.110 --> 19:56.040
Pingjun is my daughter, isn't she?

315
19:56.700 --> 19:57.900
She's not.

316
19:58.590 --> 20:00.430
She's the child

317
20:00.530 --> 20:01.900
I had after I got married.

318
20:01.900 --> 20:03.570
You have absolutely nothing to do with her.

319
20:03.570 --> 20:04.890
That can't be!

320
20:05.220 --> 20:06.620
If she's not my daughter,

321
20:07.010 --> 20:07.740
how could she have

322
20:07.740 --> 20:08.580
this half of the jade pendant

323
20:08.580 --> 20:10.220
we exchanged as a token of our love?

324
20:10.220 --> 20:10.790
Look.

325
20:16.070 --> 20:17.110
How could this be?

326
20:18.220 --> 20:19.600
She always...

327
20:20.110 --> 20:21.170
She always thought

328
20:21.270 --> 20:22.070
I'd already pawned

329
20:22.070 --> 20:23.530
this jade pendant.

330
20:23.590 --> 20:24.070
You...

331
20:24.380 --> 20:25.440
Then she must be...

332
20:33.460 --> 20:34.250
Pingjun.

333
20:35.310 --> 20:36.330
You're awake.

334
20:53.220 --> 20:54.270
So,

335
20:57.220 --> 20:59.480
Mr. Tao, you abandoned

336
21:00.510 --> 21:02.240
me and my mom for your future.

337
21:07.480 --> 21:08.720
I'm a sinner.

338
21:09.350 --> 21:11.000
I've let you both down.

339
21:11.100 --> 21:11.670
I...

340
21:11.810 --> 21:12.470
Mom.

341
21:13.950 --> 21:16.010
Why did you lie to me?

342
21:18.570 --> 21:20.570
My father wasn't the honorable man

343
21:20.570 --> 21:22.570
you made him out to be.

344
21:23.640 --> 21:25.050
He didn't love

345
21:25.070 --> 21:26.220
this family at all,

346
21:26.220 --> 21:28.440
and he never wanted a daughter like me.

347
21:29.420 --> 21:30.000
And he certainly didn't

348
21:30.000 --> 21:31.330
die in an accident

349
21:31.330 --> 21:33.190
after working himself to the bone

350
21:34.140 --> 21:36.330
to provide for us, did he?

351
21:40.720 --> 21:41.460
Pingjun.

352
21:41.510 --> 21:42.770
Forgive me.

353
21:43.590 --> 21:45.590
I shouldn't have kept this from you.

354
21:45.680 --> 21:47.110
I'm so sorry.

355
21:48.620 --> 21:50.510
So my biological father

356
21:51.940 --> 21:53.070
nearly killed me

357
21:55.030 --> 21:56.750
just now.

358
21:59.350 --> 22:00.880
I'm no better than an animal!

359
22:00.880 --> 22:02.120
I'm a sinner.

360
22:02.140 --> 22:04.280
I know you hate and resent me.

361
22:04.480 --> 22:05.790
But just now by the river,

362
22:05.790 --> 22:08.920
-why didn't you tell me... -What did you expect me to say?

363
22:09.700 --> 22:11.510
That I'm your daughter?

364
22:12.350 --> 22:15.350
Would that have stopped you from having me kidnapped,

365
22:15.770 --> 22:16.880
forcing me to kneel

366
22:16.880 --> 22:18.440
and apologize to Tao Ziyi,

367
22:18.810 --> 22:20.160
calling me a bastard,

368
22:20.160 --> 22:21.290
and throwing me into the river

369
22:21.290 --> 22:22.590
to drown?

370
22:24.610 --> 22:25.010
I...

371
22:26.070 --> 22:29.220
Just because I have no money or power,

372
22:29.980 --> 22:30.700
you think

373
22:30.730 --> 22:33.530
you can humiliate and bully me however you please.

374
22:34.480 --> 22:35.610
Mr. Tao,

375
22:36.780 --> 22:38.660
listen to me carefully.

376
22:39.660 --> 22:42.160
I have no father like you, a man who abandoned

377
22:42.180 --> 22:44.370
his wife and daughter and has no morals.

378
22:44.370 --> 22:44.700
I...

379
22:47.810 --> 22:48.810
My father

380
22:49.490 --> 22:51.050
is at Guanyin Pavilion,

381
22:51.310 --> 22:52.220
on the ancestral tablet.

382
22:52.220 --> 22:53.240
His name is Ye Zhaohe,

383
22:53.240 --> 22:54.950
and he's been dead for years!

384
22:55.570 --> 22:56.250
But...

385
22:56.400 --> 22:57.790
But what?

386
22:58.180 --> 22:59.910
Are you trying to drive my daughter to her death?

387
22:59.910 --> 23:01.080
Get out of here!

388
23:01.110 --> 23:01.480
Leave!

389
23:01.480 --> 23:02.140
I'll leave.

390
23:02.160 --> 23:02.640
Alright.

391
23:02.640 --> 23:03.400
I'll leave.

392
23:03.500 --> 23:03.900
I...

393
23:04.030 --> 23:04.480
I...

394
23:08.000 --> 23:08.790
Pingjun...

395
23:09.410 --> 23:10.360
Pingjun.

396
23:11.000 --> 23:12.480
It's all my fault.

397
23:12.850 --> 23:14.430
It's all my fault.

398
23:14.790 --> 23:15.530
Pingjun.

399
23:29.250 --> 23:30.110
Mr. Yu.

400
23:30.700 --> 23:32.710
Thank you so much for today.

401
23:33.010 --> 23:33.860
We've caused you

402
23:33.860 --> 23:35.150
so much trouble.

403
23:35.670 --> 23:36.940
We're really sorry.

404
23:36.970 --> 23:38.480
Please go home for now.

405
23:39.170 --> 23:41.150
There's no need to apologize, Auntie.

406
23:41.150 --> 23:43.050
I've made arrangements with the hospital.

407
23:43.050 --> 23:44.580
If you need anything,

408
23:45.000 --> 23:46.200
just contact Dr. Dai.

409
23:48.460 --> 23:49.160
Or

410
23:50.810 --> 23:51.660
let me know.

411
24:37.940 --> 24:38.800
Have you heard?

412
24:38.900 --> 24:40.090
Huge news.

413
24:40.240 --> 24:41.310
Ye Pingjun

414
24:41.310 --> 24:42.180
is actually President Tao's

415
24:42.180 --> 24:43.150
biological daughter.

416
24:43.150 --> 24:43.830
Really?

417
24:44.010 --> 24:44.770
No way!

418
24:45.050 --> 24:45.770
It's true.

419
24:45.770 --> 24:47.620
Word got out from Ren'ai Hospital.

420
24:47.620 --> 24:49.950
They had quite a dramatic family reunion.

421
24:51.200 --> 24:52.310
She's gone

422
24:52.740 --> 24:54.220
from rags to riches

423
24:54.250 --> 24:55.200
overnight!

424
24:55.460 --> 24:56.240
Taochun.

425
24:56.460 --> 24:57.710
Could you at least

426
24:57.730 --> 24:58.900
clean up your mouth before you open it?

427
24:58.900 --> 25:00.180
Stop spewing filth.

428
25:01.710 --> 25:03.240
What's got you so worked up?

429
25:03.530 --> 25:04.440
You think

430
25:04.440 --> 25:05.390
now that Ye Pingjun

431
25:05.390 --> 25:07.090
is a bank president's daughter,

432
25:07.090 --> 25:08.000
she'll still come back

433
25:08.000 --> 25:09.160
and put on some shabby plays with you?

434
25:09.160 --> 25:09.740
Civilized drama

435
25:09.740 --> 25:10.740
is Pingjun's ideal

436
25:10.740 --> 25:11.850
and career pursuit.

437
25:11.850 --> 25:12.790
It has nothing to do with

438
25:12.790 --> 25:14.590
whether she's a rich girl or not.

439
25:20.240 --> 25:21.470
Well, before,

440
25:21.610 --> 25:23.050
there was a huge gap in social status

441
25:23.050 --> 25:24.570
between Mr. Yu and Ye Pingjun.

442
25:24.570 --> 25:27.150
But now, they're a perfect match!

443
25:27.680 --> 25:29.570
If Mr. Yu really likes her,

444
25:29.640 --> 25:32.000
he may marry her as his principal wife right away.

445
25:32.000 --> 25:33.290
He may even take over

446
25:33.290 --> 25:34.590
this Xiangxi Hotel

447
25:34.610 --> 25:37.220
and rename it "Civilized Hall."

448
25:37.570 --> 25:38.400
Let's go.

449
25:52.660 --> 25:53.310
Master.

450
25:53.360 --> 25:55.200
All the nutritional supplements are ready.

451
25:55.200 --> 25:56.200
Would you like me to accompany you

452
25:56.200 --> 25:57.160
to the hospital to deliver them?

453
25:57.160 --> 25:57.720
No need.

454
25:58.160 --> 25:59.200
I'll go by myself.

455
25:59.790 --> 26:00.530
Okay.

456
26:06.920 --> 26:08.790
Make sure not to let Second Young Lady find out.

457
26:08.790 --> 26:09.570
If she asks,

458
26:10.720 --> 26:12.980
tell her I've gone to the bank.

459
26:13.590 --> 26:14.290
Okay.

460
26:30.790 --> 26:31.720
Redo the layout?

461
26:33.060 --> 26:35.120
Does it have to be delivered tonight?

462
26:37.270 --> 26:38.070
Sorry,

463
26:38.530 --> 26:40.050
but I really can't make it back.

464
26:40.050 --> 26:41.980
Can you figure something else out?

465
26:44.980 --> 26:45.770
Xueting.

466
26:46.000 --> 26:47.030
If there's something urgent at the newspaper,

467
26:47.030 --> 26:48.230
go take care it first.

468
26:48.400 --> 26:49.900
Go ahead and do your work.

469
26:50.110 --> 26:51.850
I'll stay here at the hospital.

470
26:53.740 --> 26:54.800
It's fine, Auntie.

471
26:55.180 --> 26:57.180
I've asked a colleague to handle it.

472
26:58.590 --> 26:59.400
Go on.

473
26:59.920 --> 27:02.160
Just come back and relieve me once you're done.

474
27:02.160 --> 27:03.460
That way, the two of us can

475
27:03.460 --> 27:05.390
take turns watching over Pingjun.

476
27:10.850 --> 27:12.650
If anything happens to Pingjun,

477
27:12.790 --> 27:14.450
please let me know right away.

478
27:15.440 --> 27:16.240
Don't worry.

479
27:16.380 --> 27:17.240
Go on now.

480
27:31.050 --> 27:31.710
Changxuan.

481
27:32.570 --> 27:33.900
How's Ye Pingjun doing?

482
27:34.110 --> 27:34.810
Dr. Dai said

483
27:34.810 --> 27:36.270
she's not doing very well.

484
27:36.290 --> 27:37.500
Since last night,

485
27:38.000 --> 27:39.800
she hasn't had any food or water.

486
27:41.200 --> 27:42.290
Postpone all my meetings this afternoon

487
27:42.290 --> 27:43.330
until tomorrow.

488
27:43.900 --> 27:44.460
Got it.

489
28:01.220 --> 28:02.010
Pingjun.

490
28:02.660 --> 28:04.390
These oranges are quite fresh.

491
28:04.720 --> 28:05.850
Try some.

492
28:27.500 --> 28:28.290
Shuwan.

493
28:28.790 --> 28:29.480
Pingjun.

494
28:30.290 --> 28:31.590
Why are you here again?

495
28:32.660 --> 28:33.460
Shuwan.

496
28:34.610 --> 28:37.510
I know my sins are unforgivable.

497
28:37.660 --> 28:39.560
But it took everything I had

498
28:39.590 --> 28:41.010
just to find you two.

499
28:41.410 --> 28:43.020
Please, just give me one more chance

500
28:43.020 --> 28:44.430
to make it up to you.

501
28:44.830 --> 28:45.790
Okay?

502
28:45.980 --> 28:46.880
The best way to make it up to us

503
28:46.880 --> 28:47.810
is to stay out of

504
28:47.810 --> 28:48.760
our lives.

505
28:48.850 --> 28:49.570
Get out!

506
28:49.590 --> 28:50.590
-Just go! -Shuwan.

507
28:50.590 --> 28:51.050
Get...

508
28:51.050 --> 28:51.810
Shuwan!

509
28:52.810 --> 28:54.000
Let me finish.

510
28:57.370 --> 28:59.590
I'm going to make a public announcement in the papers.

511
28:59.590 --> 29:01.010
I'll let everyone know

512
29:01.810 --> 29:03.610
that Pingjun is not fatherless.

513
29:04.290 --> 29:05.720
She's my, Tao Xili's,

514
29:06.680 --> 29:07.940
biological daughter.

515
29:09.090 --> 29:11.490
No matter where you two choose to live,

516
29:11.640 --> 29:13.070
whether here in Nanhuai or somewhere else,

517
29:13.070 --> 29:14.510
I'll buy you a house.

518
29:15.000 --> 29:16.200
I'll hire the best servants

519
29:16.200 --> 29:17.260
to take care of you.

520
29:19.200 --> 29:20.000
Pingjun.

521
29:20.960 --> 29:23.290
No matter what you want to do in the future,

522
29:23.960 --> 29:24.420
I'll do everything in my power

523
29:24.420 --> 29:25.900
to support you.

524
29:25.900 --> 29:26.750
Mr. Tao.

525
29:27.850 --> 29:29.830
Please stop deluding yourself.

526
29:30.960 --> 29:32.820
My mother and I have done just fine

527
29:33.550 --> 29:35.420
all these years without you.

528
29:35.850 --> 29:38.310
But I'm your biological father.

529
29:38.720 --> 29:39.940
I'll say it again.

530
29:40.850 --> 29:42.510
I don't have a father like you,

531
29:42.900 --> 29:44.900
who curries favor with the powerful

532
29:45.000 --> 29:46.800
and abandons his wife and child!

533
30:00.660 --> 30:01.160
Zi...

534
30:01.210 --> 30:02.070
Ziyi?

535
30:05.290 --> 30:05.940
You...

536
30:07.010 --> 30:08.580
Why are you here?

537
30:09.160 --> 30:09.810
Dad.

538
30:11.440 --> 30:13.570
What did she mean by that?

539
30:15.610 --> 30:16.350
Ziyi.

540
30:17.240 --> 30:19.010
D-Don't get worked up.

541
30:19.270 --> 30:20.900
Let's go home first,

542
30:20.980 --> 30:22.480
and I'll explain everything to you.

543
30:22.480 --> 30:24.410
I want a straight answer right now.

544
30:26.090 --> 30:27.880
Is what you said just now true?

545
30:36.880 --> 30:37.700
Ziyi.

546
30:38.980 --> 30:42.200
I'm sorry. I wronged you,

547
30:43.140 --> 30:44.940
and I wronged her and her mother.

548
30:44.960 --> 30:46.820
It's all my fault.

549
30:47.030 --> 30:47.870
But please,

550
30:47.900 --> 30:49.760
don't take your anger out on them.

551
30:49.810 --> 30:50.600
I...

552
30:54.380 --> 30:56.070
I'm not the one you wronged.

553
30:57.240 --> 30:58.240
It's my mother.

554
30:59.050 --> 31:00.400
Now you're going to announce to the world

555
31:00.400 --> 31:01.550
that Ye Pingjun is

556
31:01.550 --> 31:03.080
your biological daughter.

557
31:03.270 --> 31:04.800
Then what does that make me?

558
31:05.090 --> 31:06.740
And what will people think of me

559
31:06.740 --> 31:07.940
and my mother?

560
31:09.440 --> 31:11.270
My mother's been dead for years,

561
31:12.770 --> 31:15.830
and now she's going to be the subject of ridicule again.

562
31:15.900 --> 31:17.700
Have you no conscience?

563
31:17.880 --> 31:19.410
This is your family matter.

564
31:20.070 --> 31:21.600
It has nothing to do with us.

565
31:22.180 --> 31:23.980
You can take it home to settle it.

566
31:25.020 --> 31:26.840
Now, please get out.

567
31:39.700 --> 31:40.870
Ye Pingjun.

568
31:41.700 --> 31:42.900
Playing innocent,

569
31:43.240 --> 31:44.570
acting high and mighty—

570
31:45.880 --> 31:48.100
you're saying none of this has anything to do with you?

571
31:48.100 --> 31:50.700
None of this has ever had anything to do with me.

572
31:51.640 --> 31:52.740
He's your father,

573
31:53.440 --> 31:54.660
not mine.

574
31:55.770 --> 31:56.930
I've never once wanted

575
31:56.930 --> 31:58.200
to be his daughter.

576
31:58.480 --> 32:01.340
Feeling pretty pleased with yourself, aren't you?

577
32:01.500 --> 32:03.500
A sparrow about to become a phoenix,

578
32:03.680 --> 32:05.610
ready to soar to the top.

579
32:06.090 --> 32:07.320
You think this will make you

580
32:07.320 --> 32:08.540
a rich young lady?

581
32:09.740 --> 32:10.740
Dream on.

582
32:10.880 --> 32:11.770
Miss Tao,

583
32:12.090 --> 32:13.550
please show some respect.

584
32:14.290 --> 32:15.570
My daughter and I

585
32:16.070 --> 32:17.610
just want to live

586
32:17.610 --> 32:18.670
our lives in peace.

587
32:23.700 --> 32:24.830
Then why did you bring this illegitimate daughter

588
32:24.830 --> 32:25.700
of yours back?

589
32:26.740 --> 32:27.670
To blackmail us?

590
32:29.270 --> 32:30.730
To become his second wife?

591
32:30.980 --> 32:31.960
To secure a life of luxury

592
32:31.960 --> 32:33.110
for yourself?

593
32:34.530 --> 32:35.400
Tao Ziyi.

594
32:37.290 --> 32:39.090
Don't you dare insult my mother.

595
32:43.830 --> 32:44.850
Ye Pingjun.

596
32:46.570 --> 32:47.350
Do you have any idea

597
32:47.350 --> 32:49.010
what my father said about you?

598
32:52.480 --> 32:53.510
He called you

599
32:53.510 --> 32:55.380
an ill-bred bastard

600
32:57.090 --> 32:59.380
and a shameless seductress

601
32:59.980 --> 33:00.850
who stooped so low

602
33:00.850 --> 33:02.780
as to steal someone else's fiancé.

603
33:04.480 --> 33:05.570
He also said

604
33:06.940 --> 33:08.700
a woman like you

605
33:10.090 --> 33:11.880
wasn't even worthy of

606
33:12.740 --> 33:14.880
kneeling before me to put on my shoes.

607
33:18.290 --> 33:20.550
He thinks you're absolutely worthless.

608
33:20.980 --> 33:22.090
He said even mentioning your name

609
33:22.090 --> 33:23.240
makes him sick.

610
33:23.240 --> 33:24.030
He thinks you're filthy!

611
33:24.030 --> 33:24.790
Let her go!

612
33:29.240 --> 33:30.030
Dad.

613
33:31.980 --> 33:33.330
Did you forget?

614
33:34.590 --> 33:36.330
Before you left yesterday,

615
33:36.640 --> 33:37.940
you promised me

616
33:38.070 --> 33:39.350
that you'd make sure Ye Pingjun

617
33:39.350 --> 33:39.900
couldn't stand

618
33:39.900 --> 33:41.430
living in Nanhuai anymore.

619
33:41.440 --> 33:43.440
You said you'd make her wish she were dead.

620
33:43.440 --> 33:44.380
You even said

621
33:47.070 --> 33:49.400
you'd take her life.

622
34:02.380 --> 34:03.440
What's the matter?

623
34:05.940 --> 34:06.940
Say something.

624
34:09.340 --> 34:10.400
Have you gone mute?

625
34:11.340 --> 34:12.980
Why aren't you saying anything?

626
34:12.980 --> 34:14.000
Say something!

627
34:14.500 --> 34:15.400
Say something!

628
34:15.440 --> 34:16.380
Say something!

629
34:17.480 --> 34:18.190
Bastard!

630
34:19.570 --> 34:20.500
Are you okay?

631
34:30.320 --> 34:31.850
All my life,

632
34:33.900 --> 34:34.840
you've never even had the heart

633
34:34.840 --> 34:36.400
to raise your voice at me.

634
34:39.530 --> 34:41.070
And now you're actually hitting me

635
34:41.070 --> 34:42.530
over these two women

636
34:44.840 --> 34:46.500
of questionable background?

637
34:46.570 --> 34:47.380
Ziyi...

638
34:47.880 --> 34:48.360
I...

639
34:48.630 --> 34:50.380
I can explain, okay?

640
34:50.380 --> 34:52.350
I didn't mean to...

641
34:53.070 --> 34:54.670
I'll kill you.

642
34:55.170 --> 34:56.530
You ruined me!

643
34:56.730 --> 34:58.090
-You ruined me! -Let go!

644
34:58.090 --> 34:59.300
I'll kill you!

645
34:59.480 --> 35:00.670
I'll kill you!

646
35:00.980 --> 35:02.180
I'll kill you!

647
35:02.340 --> 35:03.680
I'll kill you!

648
35:03.840 --> 35:05.270
I'll kill you!

649
35:05.480 --> 35:06.590
Calm down!

650
35:06.840 --> 35:08.030
This is a hospital.

651
35:08.440 --> 35:09.770
Yu Changxuan?

652
35:15.230 --> 35:16.940
It's nearly impossible

653
35:17.980 --> 35:19.590
to get you to see me,

654
35:21.900 --> 35:24.100
but the second anything happens to her,

655
35:25.900 --> 35:27.280
you come running?

656
35:30.530 --> 35:32.530
You were born to ruin my life!

657
35:33.590 --> 35:35.460
First, you stole my fiancé,

658
35:37.110 --> 35:39.370
and now you're trying to steal my father.

659
35:39.510 --> 35:40.230
And every single one of you

660
35:40.230 --> 35:41.460
takes her side

661
35:41.650 --> 35:43.500
and gangs up on me.

662
35:47.170 --> 35:48.970
Well, let me tell you something.

663
35:49.340 --> 35:50.050
I, Tao Ziyi,

664
35:50.050 --> 35:51.730
will not stand for this!

665
35:52.090 --> 35:54.250
You'll all regret it!

666
35:55.130 --> 35:55.730
Ziyi!

667
35:56.000 --> 35:56.630
Ziyi!

668
35:59.130 --> 35:59.660
Pingjun!

669
35:59.690 --> 36:00.300
Pingjun!

670
36:00.380 --> 36:01.030
Pingjun!

671
36:01.150 --> 36:01.880
Pingjun!

672
36:01.880 --> 36:02.740
Get out of here.

673
36:04.170 --> 36:05.820
Get out of here!

674
36:06.880 --> 36:07.900
Pingjun.

675
36:08.130 --> 36:08.940
Pingjun!

676
36:09.280 --> 36:10.070
Uncle Tao.

677
36:10.980 --> 36:12.180
Given the situation,

678
36:12.280 --> 36:13.810
you'd better leave for now.

679
36:28.030 --> 36:28.840
What?

680
36:29.530 --> 36:30.530
So you mean

681
36:31.030 --> 36:32.190
Changxuan broke off his engagement

682
36:32.190 --> 36:33.660
with Tao Ziyi.

683
36:33.880 --> 36:34.690
Then, to get revenge

684
36:34.690 --> 36:36.380
for his daughter, Uncle Tao

685
36:36.380 --> 36:37.980
nearly drowned Ye Pingjun,

686
36:38.300 --> 36:40.130
only to discover

687
36:40.300 --> 36:41.190
by a twist of fate

688
36:41.190 --> 36:42.440
that Ye Pingjun

689
36:42.440 --> 36:43.670
was his own daughter?

690
36:45.070 --> 36:46.590
Oh my goodness, oh my goodness—

691
36:46.590 --> 36:48.850
this is just like something out of a play.

692
36:48.940 --> 36:50.780
It really fits those four words:

693
36:51.030 --> 36:52.630
"destined to be entangled."

694
36:53.130 --> 36:54.500
Don't talk nonsense.

695
36:55.530 --> 36:57.790
Your father doesn't know about this yet.

696
36:57.840 --> 36:59.310
If he finds out,

697
36:59.630 --> 37:00.880
it'll upset him again.

698
37:00.880 --> 37:02.940
But this whole thing has already

699
37:02.940 --> 37:05.070
caused a huge stir at Ren'ai Hospital.

700
37:05.170 --> 37:05.960
I heard

701
37:06.340 --> 37:08.670
Tao Ziyi even went there and got physical.

702
37:08.880 --> 37:10.140
It was absolute chaos.

703
37:12.880 --> 37:14.500
What was absolute chaos?

704
37:31.530 --> 37:32.340
Go on.

705
37:39.380 --> 37:40.400
That brat.

706
37:41.070 --> 37:42.670
He was the one who insisted on

707
37:42.670 --> 37:44.800
being with Tao Ziyi in the first place.

708
37:45.880 --> 37:48.280
And now he's breaking it off just like that,

709
37:48.280 --> 37:49.940
causing such a big scene.

710
37:50.880 --> 37:52.480
That little brat.

711
37:53.130 --> 37:55.730
He's always pulling these outrageous stunts!

712
37:56.130 --> 37:57.570
Calm down first.

713
37:57.730 --> 37:59.340
Don't let this upset you.

714
37:59.900 --> 38:01.340
Miss Ye is

715
38:01.690 --> 38:03.880
well-read, refined, and graceful.

716
38:04.230 --> 38:05.900
I quite like her, actually.

717
38:06.340 --> 38:07.690
Didn't you praise her yourself

718
38:07.690 --> 38:09.070
a few days ago?

719
38:09.500 --> 38:12.340
You said she had the guts to stand her ground

720
38:12.340 --> 38:15.030
and argue her case with Chu Wenfu

721
38:15.030 --> 38:15.880
over Changxuan's matter.

722
38:15.880 --> 38:17.540
You even admired her courage.

723
38:19.880 --> 38:20.980
Besides,

724
38:21.440 --> 38:22.940
we're still having this marriage alliance

725
38:22.940 --> 38:24.530
with the Tao family either way.

726
38:24.530 --> 38:27.170
We might as well go along with Changxuan's wishes.

727
38:27.170 --> 38:29.370
We'd be happy to see them together, too.

728
38:29.440 --> 38:30.970
If only it were that simple.

729
38:32.380 --> 38:33.690
I don't even know

730
38:34.230 --> 38:34.860
how I'm going to explain this

731
38:34.860 --> 38:35.940
to Tao Xili.

732
38:37.090 --> 38:39.070
President Tao is a smart man.

733
38:39.570 --> 38:41.670
Surely he can see the bigger picture.

734
38:43.900 --> 38:45.360
Let's wait and see for now.

735
38:47.280 --> 38:48.480
Let's wait and see.

736
38:56.030 --> 38:56.840
Pingjun.

737
38:58.340 --> 39:00.340
Please, say something to me.

738
39:01.900 --> 39:02.880
I know

739
39:03.900 --> 39:05.510
it's all my fault.

740
39:06.530 --> 39:08.390
I shouldn't have kept it from you.

741
39:11.030 --> 39:12.630
Please, say something to me,

742
39:12.880 --> 39:13.780
will you?

743
39:16.130 --> 39:17.400
Just say something.

744
42:00.760 --> 42:02.440
You stayed here all night?

745
42:03.380 --> 42:04.860
I thought if you woke up

746
42:05.210 --> 42:06.870
and needed someone to talk to,

747
42:07.320 --> 42:08.380
I'd be here.

748
42:13.550 --> 42:14.420
Yu Changxuan.

749
42:16.610 --> 42:17.380
Thank you.

750
42:22.570 --> 42:23.380
I know

751
42:25.320 --> 42:28.170
you're heartbroken right now,

752
42:29.560 --> 42:31.020
and you're in a lot of pain.

753
42:32.260 --> 42:34.320
But you haven't done anything wrong.

754
42:35.820 --> 42:37.750
There's no need to punish yourself

755
42:38.980 --> 42:40.640
for someone else's mistakes.

756
42:44.650 --> 42:45.670
All these years,

757
42:49.230 --> 42:51.130
no matter how hard life was,

758
42:52.510 --> 42:54.170
I did everything I could

759
42:56.420 --> 42:58.550
to give my mother a better life.

760
43:00.010 --> 43:02.110
I wanted to make my father proud.

761
43:05.070 --> 43:06.090
I wanted to become

762
43:06.090 --> 43:07.820
someone as exceptional as him.

763
43:11.190 --> 43:12.230
But now

764
43:13.960 --> 43:15.070
I realize

765
43:19.670 --> 43:21.170
it was all a joke.

766
43:30.110 --> 43:30.980
Do you remember

767
43:32.760 --> 43:35.420
when I told you about my eldest brother Mingxuan

768
43:36.360 --> 43:37.560
at Guanyin Pavilion?

769
43:41.480 --> 43:42.410
There are things

770
43:43.920 --> 43:45.050
I've kept bottled up

771
43:46.960 --> 43:48.460
for a long time.

772
43:52.760 --> 43:54.300
Once, Mingxuan and I

773
43:55.090 --> 43:56.490
went to battle together.

774
43:56.940 --> 43:58.540
We were ambushed by the enemy

775
43:59.820 --> 44:00.760
and buried

776
44:00.760 --> 44:01.890
beneath the rubble.

777
44:02.920 --> 44:04.520
The situation was critical—

778
44:04.860 --> 44:06.590
only one person could be saved.

779
44:07.650 --> 44:08.880
My dad chose Mingxuan

780
44:10.710 --> 44:11.880
and left me behind.

781
44:15.360 --> 44:16.760
But fate had other plans.

782
44:18.460 --> 44:19.380
Mingxuan died,

783
44:21.130 --> 44:22.260
and I survived.

784
44:26.760 --> 44:28.290
Mingxuan was exceptional.

785
44:29.050 --> 44:30.260
All his life,

786
44:31.530 --> 44:32.510
he'd been the center

787
44:32.510 --> 44:33.970
of everyone's attention.

788
44:34.980 --> 44:37.310
He was also the heir our father had chosen.

789
44:41.030 --> 44:41.920
For a long time, I saw him

790
44:41.920 --> 44:43.040
as my rival.

791
44:44.110 --> 44:46.170
I was always comparing myself to him,

792
44:46.760 --> 44:48.010
trying to catch up

793
44:49.050 --> 44:49.980
and surpass him.

794
44:51.780 --> 44:53.840
I'd grown so used to chasing after him

795
44:55.780 --> 44:56.570
that

796
44:58.210 --> 44:59.320
when he died,

797
45:01.050 --> 45:02.050
it felt as though

798
45:04.460 --> 45:05.400
everything in my life had suddenly

799
45:05.400 --> 45:06.500
lost its meaning.

800
45:18.170 --> 45:19.630
What happened after that?

801
45:28.050 --> 45:29.550
After that, I met a girl

802
45:30.510 --> 45:31.760
who taught me

803
45:33.880 --> 45:34.840
not to get trapped in

804
45:34.840 --> 45:36.710
empty obsessions.

805
45:38.030 --> 45:39.960
That we should live for ourselves,

806
45:42.000 --> 45:43.530
and there's no need to prove

807
45:43.920 --> 45:46.380
the value and meaning of your life to others.

808
45:50.260 --> 45:51.110
You've written so many

809
45:51.110 --> 45:52.770
stirring, passionate plays.

810
45:54.760 --> 45:57.070
You've taught all those orphans to read and write.

811
45:57.070 --> 45:57.960
You've given so many people

812
45:57.960 --> 46:00.160
the dignity and courage to keep living.

813
46:00.880 --> 46:03.360
Was all that just to prove

814
46:03.920 --> 46:06.650
you were a daughter your father could be proud of?

815
46:06.800 --> 46:08.110
Just because the image of your father

816
46:08.110 --> 46:08.940
has crumbled,

817
46:09.480 --> 46:10.170
does that mean you've lost

818
46:10.170 --> 46:11.650
all the courage and strength

819
46:11.650 --> 46:12.910
to get back on your feet

820
46:13.980 --> 46:15.210
and keep going?

821
46:19.730 --> 46:20.360
Pingjun.

822
46:22.690 --> 46:23.420
You always know

823
46:23.420 --> 46:24.630
what you want.

824
46:26.880 --> 46:28.810
I know you can figure this out, too.

825
46:30.980 --> 46:31.570
If this relationship

826
46:31.570 --> 46:32.920
has hurt you,

827
46:34.550 --> 46:35.630
you can try

828
46:35.660 --> 46:37.390
keeping your distance from it,

829
46:37.650 --> 46:38.460
or even

830
46:39.170 --> 46:40.970
redefining what it means to you.

831
46:42.550 --> 46:44.010
You don't have to be bound

832
46:44.780 --> 46:46.230
by so-called blood ties.

833
46:47.820 --> 46:49.820
Right now, the most important thing

834
46:50.260 --> 46:51.860
is to live your own life well.

835
47:15.780 --> 47:16.400
Look,

836
47:18.090 --> 47:19.530
the sun rises every day.

837
47:22.110 --> 47:24.040
No matter how long the night may be,

838
47:25.550 --> 47:26.950
it will eventually pass.

839
47:49.190 --> 47:50.470
In your future,

840
47:51.630 --> 47:53.560
there are so many wonderful things

841
47:54.510 --> 47:55.860
waiting for you.

842
48:09.880 --> 48:10.820
Ye Pingjun.

843
48:11.670 --> 48:13.180
I've finally found you.

844
48:14.300 --> 48:15.530
From now on,

845
48:16.980 --> 48:18.480
I'll never let you leave again.
